Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:37.40,Note,,0,0,0,,(开普吉拉多市 密苏里州)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.70,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:05.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:08.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take your brother outside as fast as you can. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:20.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸的笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:22.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:24.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:26.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得找到爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是现在我唯一想干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随着气温达到零度以下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With temperatures hitting below zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:42.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经得到了全县的天气异常的冷锋设置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we've got an unseasonably cold front setting throughout the county.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:46.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}针对I- 55我们得到大概的结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got some pretty rough going reportedly on I-55...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:49.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北风时速40英里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with winds out of the north at 40 miles an hour...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:33.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为争夺100亿美元的预算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Republicans are $1 0 billion away from a budget deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:37.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共和党人像一吨钱一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}fighting over what seems like a ton of money....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的. - 我想到办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. I think I found a way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:58.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这样从东面绕过这个建筑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can bypass that construction east of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:02.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样 去宾西法尼亚 我们会比我们想象的到得更早些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We might even make Pennsylvania faster than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:05.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是 我们不去宾西法尼亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The problem is, we're not going to Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚刚接到一个老朋友的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just got a call from an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:12.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的父亲昨天被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her father was killed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她认为这也许是我们所管的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Might be our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:15.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:16.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不会给我打电话的 永远不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she never would've called, never
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:20.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果她不需要我们的帮助的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she didn't need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去还是不去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. You coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:37.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说老朋友 你的意思是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By "old friend, " you mean...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A friend that's not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.93,0:03:41.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的名字叫 凯西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So her name's Cassie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从来没提起过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You never mentioned her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:47.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:48.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:49.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们曾经在一起过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, we went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说 你和某人约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean you dated somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:53.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不只是一个晚上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For more than one night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听不懂我说的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am l speaking a language you're not getting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:59.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸和我在俄亥俄的雅典市做工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad and l were working a job in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.43,0:04:02.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她正在上大学 我们一起出去了几个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was finishing up college. We went out for a couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:03.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她爸爸的事情很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, it's terrible about her dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:11.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是听起来就像是标准的车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but kind of sounds like a standard car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不认为这是我们应该做的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not seeing how it fits with what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:17.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便问一下 她怎么知道我们是干什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which, by the way, how does she know what we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:24.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉了她 你把秘密告诉了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You told her. You told her, the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们家族 第一条规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our big family rule number one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做我们该做的事 并且闭口不言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do what we do and we shut up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一年半 我一直在对杰西卡撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For a year l do nothing but lie to Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和这个女孩出去了几次就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You go out with this chick in Ohio a couple times...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:36.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉了她所有的事情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you tell her everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 是的 是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dean. - Yeah. Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们这里出版的一份报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's a newspaper we put out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:48.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是市长办公室的公告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a bulletin for the mayor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你这些东西拿走 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get off your soap box, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要一些判断力 就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm urging a little discretion, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我想你再告诉我们你想让我们报道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. I think you're telling us what you want us to print...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我们调查什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and what you want us to sit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:59.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你很伤心凯西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you're upset, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常喜欢你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I liked your dad a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.93,0:05:04.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 我想你的悲痛影响了你的判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but l think your grief is clouding your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:07.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在同样的一段路上 两个黑人被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two black people were killed on the road in the same way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在三周的时间里 同样的手法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉米 你和这件事情的联系太紧密了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jimmy, you're too close to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those guys were friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:17.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你失去的朋友我们非常悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again, l'm very sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:30.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:32.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 凯西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:40.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的弟弟 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is my brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:45.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你的父亲 我很伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:49.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妈妈的情形不是很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My mother's in pretty bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直和她在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been staying with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望她不会被自己吓坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish she wouldn't go off by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她神经紧张 非常容易受到惊吓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's been so nervous and frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:04.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她很担心爸爸的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was worried about Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:05.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.80,0:06:06.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:08.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看见了一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:08.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:12.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 他发誓他看到一辆很可怕的黑色卡车跟踪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He said He swore he saw an awful-looking black truck following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辆卡车？谁是司机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A truck? Who was the driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没提过司机 只是卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He didn't talk about a driver. Just the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:20.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说它出现然后消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He said it would appear and disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:23.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在车祸中 爸爸的卡车出现了凹痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And, in the accident, Dad's truck was dented...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:26.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像被某些大的物体撞击过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}like it'd been slammed into by something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:27.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你敢肯定以前没有那个凹痕？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, you're sure this dent wasn't there before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:33.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是卖汽车的 他一直开新车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sold cars. Always drove a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:35.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的车连刮伤都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There wasn't a scratch on that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:39.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天晚上雨下得很大 到处是泥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It had rained hard that night. There was mud everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:44.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一辆汽车的痕迹延伸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a distinct set of muddy tracks from Dad's car
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:45.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leading right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:50.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的车翻下公路的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the edge where he went over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:54.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辆车的汽车留下的泥痕 他自己的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One set of tracks. His.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一个被杀的人是你父亲的一个朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first was a friend of your father's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好的朋友克莱顿·索尔姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Best friend. Clayton Soames.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一起享有汽车经销权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They owned the car dealership together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的事情 凹痕 没有其它汽车的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Same thing. Dent. No tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:07.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察说了和父亲死的那天同样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the cops said exactly what they said about Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的车失去了控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"He lost control of his car."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:11.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能想到你父亲和他的合伙人成为目标的原因吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any reason why your father and his partner might be targets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:12.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:15.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为那个消失的卡车把他撞下了公路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This truck ran them off the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you say it aloud like that....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:24.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对鬼魂的存在与否有一点怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, l'm a little skeptical about this ghost stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是你们所作的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or whatever it is you guys are into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Skeptical?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:30.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我记得没错的话 我想你说过我是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I remember, I think you said l was nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是过去的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:39.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我没法解释发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just know l can't explain what happened up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:41.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我打电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So l called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:45.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈 你去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom. Where have you been? l was....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:49.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你带朋友回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had no idea you had invited friends over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:54.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈 这是迪恩大学里的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom, this is Dean, a friend of mine from college.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:56.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他的弟弟萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:08:00.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会打扰你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l won't interrupt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 罗宾逊夫人 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mrs. Robinson. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于您丈夫的死 我们很伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:07.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不介意的话 我们想跟您谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'd like to talk to you for a minute, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:12.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我还没准备好谈这些问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm really not up to that just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:10.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉米在这个镇上还是有一定影响的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jimmy meant something to this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我们最棒的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was one of our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有他会大不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We won't be the same without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:16.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们最棒的人就像苍蝇一样死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our best seem to be dropping like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:19.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱顿 我父亲 吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clayton, my father, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:21.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底想让我做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it exactly you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}封了这条路怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How about closing this section of road, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}封闭主干路？小镇唯一通往外界的路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Close the main road, the only road in and out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:32.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车祸是有发生 凯西 车祸就是车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Accidents do happen, Cassie. That's what they are. Accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察检查吉米汽车上的凹痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did the cops check for additional denting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看他是不是被撞下去的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See if it was pushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:37.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 和萨姆·温彻斯特家里的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean and Sam Winchester. Family friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:42.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的市长哈罗·德托德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Mayor Harold Todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:46.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一辆汽车的痕迹 只有一个 证明不是谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's one set of tire tracks. One. Doesn't point to foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:49.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}市长 警察和镇上的官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayor, the police and town officials
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:50.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按你的指示办事 如果你不关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ke their cues from you. lf you're indifferent
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不关心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lndifferent?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:55.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果受害者是白人的话 你会封闭公路吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you close the road if the victims were white?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:57.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说我是种族主义者 凯西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You suggesting l'm racist, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:10:01.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不该对我这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm the last person you should talk to like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:02.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:04.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不问问你妈妈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you ask your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:13.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要为她辩解一下 她很勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll say this for her, she's fearless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:14.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:17.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢打赌 他会踢你的屁股的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bet she kicked your ass a couple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:23.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有意思的是 你们从没同时看过对方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's interesting is, you guys never look at each other at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:25.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看她的时候 她没再看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look at her when she's not looking...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:27.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她看你的时候 你又再往一边看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she checks you out when you look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:33.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有趣的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just an interesting observation in a.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:36.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常有意思的观察角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know observationally interesting way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:39.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我们这里有比这更紧迫的事情吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think we might have more pressing issues here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:42.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我触动了你的某条神经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, if l'm hitting a nerve
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰了 你是罗恩·斯塔宾斯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me, are you Ron Stubbins?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉米·安德森的朋友？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were friends with Jimmy Anderson?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:04.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们和安德森一起的 保险公司的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Anderson's insurance company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:08.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到这做一些调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here to dot l's and cross it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:08.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:11.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死者最近有没有不寻常的经历？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had the deceased mentioned any unusual experiences?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不寻常 是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean, "unusual"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:16.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}视觉上的幻觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, visions, hallucinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:19.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是医学上的检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all part of a medical examination kind of thing. Very standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:23.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说你是哪个公司的？- All tional mutual.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hat company you say you're with? - All tional mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我他是不是说过他看见了一辆卡车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me, did he ever mention seeing a truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辆黑色的大卡车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A big black truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:31.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不明白你在说什么？你在说英语吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell you talking about? You even speaking English?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:35.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一辆看起来很可怕的大卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son, this truck, a big, scary monster-looking thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:37.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上是的 我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, actually, l think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.83,0:11:42.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说过一辆那样的大卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l have heard of a truck like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:43.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听说过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:44.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:46.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是在哪 什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not where, when.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在六十年代 那时候 有一连串的死亡事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back in the '60s, there was a string of deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:52.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Black men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:56.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在一辆黑色的 肮脏的大卡车里消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Story goes, they disappeared in a big, nasty black truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没抓到凶手吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They ever catch the guy who did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:11:59.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:04.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪 不清楚他们到底有没有调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, not sure they even really looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See, there was a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:11.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个小镇不是对每个居民都很友好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this town wasn't too friendly to all its citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:16.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:23.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直在出现 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keeps coming up, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在想 你听说过会飞的幽灵船吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was thinking. You heard of the Flying Dutchman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 一艘鬼船 被船长邪恶的鬼魂笼罩着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, a ghost ship, infused with the captaings spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:30.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}船就是他的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was part of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我们是不是遇到了同样的事情了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what if we're dealing with a phantom truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:36.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个被鬼魂附着的卡车幻影 历史重演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The extension of some bastard ghost re-enacting past crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受害者都是黑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The victims have all been black men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:39.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想还不止这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:41.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们好像都和凯西和她的家人有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They all seem connected to Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.71,0:12:44.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你负责那个天使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Well, you work that angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.03,0:12:46.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去和她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:49.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 也许你想说一些其他的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, and, you might also want to mention that other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.73,0:12:51.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What other thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:54.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}严肃的没有谈完的话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The serious unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你们俩之间发生了什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, what is going on between you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:01.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之间发生的事情比我告诉你的要多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were a little bit more involved than l said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许多得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, a lot more. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉她我是做什么的 我不应该这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told her the secret about what we do and l shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:12.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 有时候 每个人都需要对某人敞开心扉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, man, everybody's gotta open up to someone sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但是我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, l don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:16.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她靠得那么近是很愚蠢的 看这样的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was stupid to get that close. I mean, look how it ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:20.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要不要别再\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:22.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Blink or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:31.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你曾经爱过她 但是你抛弃了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were in love with her, but you dumped her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她甩了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She dumped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:00.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dean. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很忙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you busy or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.05,0:14:11.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在写一篇论文 在吉米y那有什么发现吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The paper's doing a tribute to Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.90,0:14:16.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在看他的东西 他的奖品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, I was just going through his stuff......his awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:18.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是着找些线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trying to find the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定很困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's gotta be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:26.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些年 这个家开办了一份报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This family owned the paper. The Dorians?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:28.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们保持着只雇用白人之类的政策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They had a whites-only staff policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:30.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们买了报社以后吉米是第一个黑人记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After they sold it, Jimmy became the first black reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他又当上了编辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He didn't stop until he became editor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他教给我很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He taught me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:38.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的弟弟在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 什么风把你吹来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. So, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:47.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在寻找三个受害者之间的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trying to find the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便问一下 你和你妈妈谈过了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the way, did you talk to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:51.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于托德说不是种族主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About Todd not being racist?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:55.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她不想说这件事 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- She didn't wanna talk about it. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:01.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚才 你为什么问我弟弟在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So just then, why'd you ask where my brother was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing. Not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:04.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许因为没有他在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because without him here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:06.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就剩下你和我了 而不是你 我 和萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's you and me, not you, me and Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:07.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样就会轻松一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which would be easier?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:08.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not. lt's not easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.33,0:15:11.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 忘了吧 这样很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Forget it. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:13.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到正题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll keep it strictly business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:18.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忘了你会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I forgot you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:19.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无什么时候 我们接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whenever we get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:26.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要说什么？很近？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the word, "close"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:29.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要谈到感情问题时 你总是退缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anywhere in the neighborhood of emotional vulnerability, you back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:30.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or make some joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者找办法逃避把我拒之门外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or find any way to shut the door on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这挺好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:38.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我不是那个关上起决定性的那个大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not the one who took that door.Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且 我也不是那个 那个拿了钥匙又埋起来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who took the key and buried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们结束这个比喻了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We done with this metaphor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说的是 当我决心面对问题的时候 你却在逃避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was totally up-front with you and you nailed me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你抓住了这个把柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy l'm with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:48.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不希望这个也许能和我共度一生的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy I'm hoping might be in my future...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:50.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我他是专业驱逐鬼魂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tells me he pops ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:51.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是我使用的字眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those aren't the words I used.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必须离开去和他父亲工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has to leave to work with his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:53.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:55.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想的是 如果你想分手 那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you want out, fine
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:57.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是别告诉我这个疯狂的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't tell me this insane story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是事实凯西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:01.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你认为我能帮忙的时候 听起来没有那么疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It didn't sound insane the minute you thought l could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:03.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时 我以为你要甩掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you just wanted to dump me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了 当初谁甩的谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa, let's not forget who dumped who, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.93,0:16:08.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你想让我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l thought it's what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:09.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I didn't mean to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 你伤害了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.10,0:16:12.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:14.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:17.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该多吵架. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should fight more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:24.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 我们很擅长吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually, we were always pretty good at fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.56,0:18:27.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我们很擅长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This we were good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:31.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是其他的事就不这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all the other stuff, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:32.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:38.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉了你我是谁 那是我很大的进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}told you who l really was. That was a big first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:39.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why'd you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:47.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜我不想对你撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess I couldn't lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你告诉我那个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You told me that story...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:59.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把我吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时以为你是一个傻瓜 还很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you were nuts. Dangerous even.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:07.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:11.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我当时在找一个离开的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}maybe l was looking for a reason to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:17.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我工作时 我看到过很多恐怖的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my work...I see some horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:20.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没法解释的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Things that can't be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我解决它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:24.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是解决我们之间的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But working things out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:27.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很恐怖 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm a scary one, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:28.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:38.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常 如果你希望事情得到解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, usually things get worked out...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:40.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们就会得到解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you really want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:50.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我非常关心我爸爸的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, but l'm still really involved with my dad's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:56.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要再找借口了好吗？你我都不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}more excuses, okay? From you or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:16.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:20.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和我是一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你昨晚在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where were you last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:35.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有回汽车旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't make it back to the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:36.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:37.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你们有进展了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You guys worked things out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:40.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们90岁时 也许会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll be working things out when we're 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.13,0:20:41.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:43.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每块骨头都粉碎了 内脏几乎成了布丁状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every bone crushed. Internal organs turned to pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:45.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察都被难住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cops are stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:47.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像他被某物撞倒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like something ran him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如卡车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something like a truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:49.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有痕迹？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:50.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:53.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}市长在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What was the mayor doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:55.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有了一些财产 前几个星期购买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He owned the property. Bought it a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:57.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但是他是白人 不符合特征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he's white, doesn't fit the pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:58.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谋杀不是发生在公路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Killings didn't happen up on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.76,0:21:00.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也不符合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That doesn't fit, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:09.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:14.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在找六十年代发生的谋杀之间的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm trying to find some link between the '60s and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:15.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸上没有太多的报道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There wasn't a lot about it in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不惊奇 也许是警察的大事化小 小事化了的做法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not surprising. Probably minimal police work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:22.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时 这儿的法律 没有过多的文书记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back then, equal justice under the law wasn't too literal around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:28.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法院的纪录记载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The records......
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}市长夫妇购买了一份被遗弃的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show that Mr. Mayor bought an abandoned property.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:35.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先前的所有这是多利安一家 有150年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The previous owner was the Dorian family for, like, 150 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:35.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多利安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dorian?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:36.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:38.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是说过多利安一家是报社的所有者？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Didn't the Dorian family used to own this paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:40.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这所有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Along with most everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.83,0:21:42.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这个小镇的栋梁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Real pillars of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:43.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:50.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:53.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个赛勒斯·多利安在63年4月失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This Cyrus Dorian.He vanished in April of '63.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:56.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们调查了这个案子 但是没有解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The case was investigated, but never solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也是一系列谋杀案发生的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's the time the murders were going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:00.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在多利安家里找到了一堆报纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pulled paper up on the Dorian place. Must've been in bad shape...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:02.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当市长买那些财产的时候 当时这个地方一定很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when the mayor bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.10,0:22:03.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么这么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:05.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他做的第一件事就是平整了这片土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first thing he did was bulldoze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.83,0:22:08.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托德市长拆了那个房子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayor Todd knocked down the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.03,0:22:11.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一桩大买卖 那是小镇遗留下来的最老的房子之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a big deal. One of the oldest local houses left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.73,0:22:13.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成了头版头条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made the front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是在哪天发生的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:17.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上月3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, the 3rd of last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:25.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托德市长 3号 拆了多利安的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayor Todd bulldozed the Dorian family home on the 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:28.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一起谋杀是在第二天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The first killing was the very next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.80,0:23:52.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean. Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:01.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你可以调查一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe you could throw a couple shots in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.48,0:24:04.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有看见谁开卡车？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You didn't see who was driving the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:09.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seemed to be no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.91,0:24:14.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切变化得太快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything was moving so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.81,0:24:17.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后它就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then it was just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:20.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么它没有杀了我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't it kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.95,0:24:23.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是什么控制着卡车 他想要让你害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever's controlling the truck wants you afraid first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.35,0:24:30.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗宾逊夫人 凯西说你的丈夫看见了卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Robinson, Cassie said that your husband saw the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.05,0:24:31.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他死之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.71,0:24:34.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:35.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:39.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马丁当时压力很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Martin was under a lot of stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:41.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能肯定他当时看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't be sure about what he was seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:43.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚以后 我想我们有理由肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After tonight, we can be reasonably sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.78,0:24:45.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看见的是一辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he was seeing a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:48.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚发生了的事说明 你和凯西被人盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened tonight, you and Cassie are marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:52.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的女儿会死的 所以如果你知道什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay? Your daughter could die. So if you know something...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:54.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在告诉我们 这是非常恰当的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now would be a good time to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:55.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:56.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.75,0:24:59.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他说他看见了卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. He said he saw a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.45,0:25:01.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说卡车是谁的了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did he know who it belonged to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.68,0:25:02.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他认为他知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He thought he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.98,0:25:03.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.05,0:25:07.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.05,0:25:10.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个人叫赛勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man named Cyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.85,0:25:17.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这人是赛勒斯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this Cyrus?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:23.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛勒斯·多利安四十多年前就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cyrus Dorian died more than 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.81,0:25:27.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道他死了 罗宾逊夫人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you know he died, Mrs. Robinson?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸上说他失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The paper said he went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.71,0:25:34.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道他死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you know he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.08,0:25:37.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们当时都很年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were all very young.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.71,0:25:42.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和赛勒斯 约会了一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dated Cyrus a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.61,0:25:45.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时也偷偷地和马丁在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was also seeing Martin. In secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:51.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为不同人种之间的结合结果都不是很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of course because interracial couples didn't go over too well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.98,0:25:57.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和赛勒斯 分手 当他发现马丁的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I broke it off with Cyrus and when he found out about Martin...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:26:02.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道… 他变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't know, he changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.95,0:26:08.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的愤怒 他的愤怒很令人害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}s hatred. His hatred was frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.78,0:26:10.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于一系列的谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The string of murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.28,0:26:15.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有谣言说 黑人失踪在一种能自动驾驶的卡车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There were rumors. People of color disappearing into some kind of a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.98,0:26:21.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于这件事 人们并没有做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing was ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:27.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马丁和…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Martin and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.90,0:26:30.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马丁和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Martin and I
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:37.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来都没有想要 在这附近的小教堂里结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were gonna be married in that little church near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.12,0:26:40.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 最后我们决定私奔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But last minute, we decided to elope because
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:42.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们不想引起注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We didn't want the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.39,0:26:43.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛勒斯呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Cyrus...?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.35,0:26:55.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们决定的婚期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The day we set for the wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.69,0:27:01.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是教堂起火的那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was the day someone set fire to the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.32,0:27:14.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有个儿童唱诗班在那儿练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There was a children's choir practicing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.99,0:27:20.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They all died.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.55,0:27:24.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}袭击事件就此停止了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did the attacks stop after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.25,0:27:28.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 还有一件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. There was one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.09,0:27:34.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天晚上 卡车来找马丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One night, that truck came for Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.07,0:27:39.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛勒斯狠狠地打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cyrus beat him something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:47.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是马丁 他解脱出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Martin, you see, Martin got loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.75,0:27:50.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始打赛勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he started hitting Cyrus...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:54.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一直不停的打他. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he just kept hitting him and hitting him and....
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.09,0:28:08.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不叫警察？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't he call the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.75,0:28:15.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是40年前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was 40 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.99,0:28:18.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他召来了他的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He called on his friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:21.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克莱顿和吉米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clayton Soames and Jimmy Anderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.59,0:28:24.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们把赛勒斯的尸体放进了卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they put Cyrus' body into the truck...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.55,0:28:29.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后把车推进了土地边缘的沼泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and rolled it into the swamp at the edge of his land...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:36.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么多年来 他们守口如瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all three of them kept that secret all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.09,0:28:39.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他们三个都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now all three are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.55,0:28:40.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托德市长也死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So is Mayor Todd.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.42,0:28:45.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说 你是这么多人中最清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, he said that you of all people would know
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.75,0:28:47.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是种族主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not a racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.59,0:28:48.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他要这么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.65,0:28:49.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.69,0:28:52.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时他是个年轻的副官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a young deputy back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.99,0:28:54.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}调查赛勒斯的失踪案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}investigating Cyrus' disappearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.75,0:29:00.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他发现马丁和其他的人都干了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once he figured out what Martin and the others had done...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.49,0:29:06.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.95,0:29:11.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他也知道赛勒斯都做了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he also knew what Cyrus had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.15,0:29:15.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你没有告诉我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.85,0:29:18.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我在保护他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought l was protecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.59,0:29:25.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在没有人需要我袒护了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now there's no one left to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:27.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.35,0:29:38.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的生活很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, my life was so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.49,0:29:42.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是上学 考试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just school, exams...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:46.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多中心文化规范的论文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}papers on polycentric cultural norms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:50.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我猜我把你从无聊的生活中解救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess I saved you from a boring existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.45,0:29:52.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偶尔我还会想念无聊的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Occasionally, l miss boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:29:55.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 这杀人卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So this killer truck....
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.99,0:29:59.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真希望对话不是以杀人卡车开头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I miss conversations that didn't start with "this killer truck."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.89,0:30:02.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:04.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 这个叫赛勒斯的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, so this Cyrus guy. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从某种角度讲他很邪恶 甚至影响了他的卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evil on a level that infected even his truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:10.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他死了 沼泽成了他的坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When he died, the swamp became his tomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.52,0:30:12.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的灵魂隐匿了40年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his spirit was dormant for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.89,0:30:14.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么什么唤醒了他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what woke it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:16.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的房子的修建或者损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The construction on his house. Or the destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.72,0:30:17.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.85,0:30:20.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}破坏或者重新改造能唤醒灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Demolition or remodeling can awaken spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.65,0:30:22.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让它们不得安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make them restless.Mm hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.39,0:30:24.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像伊利诺斯州的歌剧院一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like that theater in lllinois?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.79,0:30:26.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.05,0:30:28.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推倒家宅的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the guy who tears down the family homestead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:29.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈罗德·托德就是那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}, Harold Todd is
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:33.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对赛勒斯的凶杀案保持沉默 并且没有解决那个案子的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same guy that kept Cyrus' murder quiet and unsolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:36.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他的灵魂被唤醒 出来进行血腥的谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So now his spirit is awakened and out for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.39,0:30:38.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的想法 谁知道鬼魂是怎么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess. Who knows what ghosts are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.69,0:30:41.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要把尸体从沼泽里挖出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know we're gonna have to dredge that body up from the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.09,0:30:43.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.72,0:30:45.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你竟然这么说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.05,0:30:46.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.09,0:30:47.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.09,0:30:48.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.09,0:30:50.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.15,0:30:52.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.25,0:30:53.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要保持清醒 看护着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you stay put and look after her...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.99,0:30:56.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会回来 别离开房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we'll be back. Don't leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.09,0:30:58.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别命令我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't go getting all authoritative on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.32,0:30:59.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最恨这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:03.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请别离开房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't leave the house, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:18.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来不来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:25.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我们现在把它拉上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Let's get her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:30.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上来点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.59,0:31:32.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上来点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Little more. Little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.79,0:31:35.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在上来点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.02,0:31:37.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.89,0:31:47.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.05,0:31:48.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.15,0:31:50.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我知道她看上你什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now l know what she sees in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.55,0:31:51.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.82,0:31:54.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以承认 你还爱着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, admit it. You're still in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:55.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们集中精神好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aw, could we focus, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.69,0:31:57.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是说说迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just saying, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.55,0:31:58.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 拿着那个 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hold that. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.59,0:32:01.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拿着什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What am l getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:01.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦斯手电筒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gas, flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.05,0:32:02.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.82,0:32:04.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们把它拉上来 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Let's get this done. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.89,0:32:25.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我们开始干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:42.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样就行了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think that'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:50.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.01,0:32:59.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}烧了尸体就对那东西没有影响吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So burning the body had no effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.38,0:33:01.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 当然有 - 现在它很愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Sure it did. - Now it's really pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:03.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但是赛勒斯灵魂已经走了 是吗 迪恩？- 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- But Cyrus' ghost is gone. - right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.49,0:33:05.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然不是控制着卡车的那部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not the part that's fused with the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:07.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.36,0:33:09.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去兜风 - 什么？- 把那东西带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- For a little ride. - What? - Lead that thing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.76,0:33:11.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个生锈的骰子 你最好烧了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That piece of crap, burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么烧一个骰子 迪恩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How am l supposed to burn it? - l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.23,0:33:15.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 自己想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:17.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Figure something...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.97,0:33:59.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 你得给我点时间 - 我们没有时间了 你在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Give me a minute. - l don't have a minute.What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.83,0:34:02.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一会在和你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, let me get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.81,0:34:06.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 卡西？嘿 这是萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Cassie? Hey, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.85,0:34:09.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你告诉我一些事情 必须要准确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, l need some information and it has to be exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.95,0:34:14.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好吧 迪恩 - 这最好变得顺利点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- All right. - This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.68,0:34:15.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.30,0:34:18.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在半路上 在杀人卡车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The middle of nowhere with a killer truck on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:20.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它好像知道我烧了赛勒斯的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It knows l put the torch to Cyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:22.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩听着 这很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen. lt's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:23.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须知道你确切的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to know exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.35,0:34:25.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪凯特大街 离高速公路两英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Decatur Road, about two miles off the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.78,0:34:26.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向东行驶？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Headed east?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.55,0:34:27.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.72,0:34:38.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向右拐 向右 向右拐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, turn right. Up ahead, turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:45.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你转弯了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You make the turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.18,0:34:46.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我转弯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.62,0:34:48.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把那个东西再开快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move this thing along a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.38,0:34:49.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见前面有一条路？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see a road up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.98,0:34:51.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.22,0:34:52.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 是的 我看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.98,0:34:53.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 左转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.58,0:34:54.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.08,0:35:03.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 现在怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:05.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精确行驶0. -7英里然后停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go seven tenths of a mile and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.68,0:35:06.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.35,0:35:08.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精确的 7/10英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}DeanExactly seven-tenths, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.38,0:35:10.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}7/10 7/10\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seven-tenths, seven-tenths.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.92,0:35:43.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩你还在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.08,0:35:43.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.95,0:35:44.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.78,0:35:46.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它正在盯着我 我该怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's staring at me. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.78,0:35:49.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 做你正在做的事 - 把它引过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What you are doing. - Bringing it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:50.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.32,0:36:08.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.88,0:36:32.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还在吗？Dean？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean? You still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.82,0:36:35.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.68,0:36:38.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.12,0:36:41.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你正在教堂的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, you're where the church was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.35,0:36:42.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么教堂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What church?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.62,0:36:45.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赛勒斯烧的地方 杀了所有的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The place Cyrus burned down. Murdered those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.87,0:36:47.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有留下什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's not a lot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.09,0:36:48.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教堂的土地是神圣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Church ground is hallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.82,0:36:50.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管教堂是否还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whether the church is there or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:52.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶的灵魂在神圣的土地周围盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evil spirits cross over hallowed ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:53.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候他们被损坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes they're destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.83,0:36:58.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想那也许能除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So l figured maybe that would get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.80,0:37:01.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.33,0:37:03.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一你是错的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if you were wrong? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:08.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 我从来没这么想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Honestly, that thought hadn't occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:14.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 我从来没遇到这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Well, it honestly didn't occur to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.80,0:37:22.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.05,0:37:35.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妈妈说再次谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My mother says to tell you thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.02,0:37:42.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比上次的再见要好得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a better goodbye than last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.95,0:37:46.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这次离别 没有那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, well, maybe this time it'll be a little less permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.22,0:37:52.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗？我是个现实主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}u know what? I'm a realist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.16,0:37:55.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们之间没有希望 Dean\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't see much hope for us, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.87,0:38:01.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我见过一些人 他们彼此是陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l've seen stranger things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他们最后走到了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell of a lot stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:11.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Goodbye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.58,0:38:13.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会再见到你的cassie\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll see you, Cassie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.58,0:38:17.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.58,0:39:09.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:11.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.70,0:39:15.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你见到过像她一样的女孩吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You meet someone like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.18,0:39:17.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ever make you wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:22.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们为了我们的工作付出这么多 值得吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it's worth it putting everything else on hold, doing what we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:39.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当轮到我开车的时候叫醒我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you wake me up when it's my turn to drive?
